<title>USA: Rite Aid Dec same store sales up 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Rite Aid Dec same store sales up 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CAMP HILL, Penn. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $830.3     $481.2	+72.5	 +8.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $5,143.3   $4,496.2	+14.4	 +7.4</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended   December 28.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			 Rite Aid Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: Pharmacy same store sales rose 13.6 percent and non-pharmacy same-store sales rose 3.2 percent in the four weeks ended December 28, 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>Total sales for the recent four weeks ended December 28 included $292.8 million in sales attributable to Thrifty PayLess Inc from the December 12 acquisition date, it said.</p>
</text>
